body:
Fix to the modified product jumping to bottom of the cart

Instead of appending the updated foundProduct to the end of the cartItems array we can:

//update foundProduct quantity
  foundProduct = { ...foundProduct, quantity: foundProduct.quantity + 1 };

//splice foundProduct back into its original index
  newCartItems.splice(index, 0, foundProduct);

//update state
  setCartItems([...newCartItems]);

